<title>ITALY: Italy tax revenue up 4.2 pct Jan-March 97.</title>
<headline>Italy tax revenue up 4.2 pct Jan-March 97.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's tax revenue rose 4.2 percent to 111.635 trillion lire in the first three months of 1997 compared to the same period in 1996, the Finance Ministry said on Monday.</p>
<p>It added that tax revenue fell 3.0 percent in January, followed by a 22.3 percent rise in February and a fall of 4.1 percent in March. --Rome newsroom +396-678-2501</p>
</text>
